* Nexperia BCM847DS (NPN) / BCM857DS (PNP) matched-pair transistors.
* Model parameters copied verbatim from the vendor files in models/ (ngspice needs the keyword form area=; to be confirmed in LTspice).
* Vendor note: "Spicemodel does not include temperature dependency" (XTB=0); Vbe(T) still follows EG/XTI.
* AR = emitter-area ratio for Vbe-mismatch injection, dVbe = NF*VT*ln(AR).
.subckt QNCORE c b e AR=1
Q1 c b e BCM847 area={AR}
.ends QNCORE
* The vendor PNP is a small subcircuit (quasi-saturation / reverse-mode helper parts).
.subckt QPCORE c b e AR=1
Q1 c   b e BCM857 area={0.9196*AR}
Q2 c11 b e BCM857 area={0.08035*AR}
D1 c b BCM857D area={AR}
RQ1 c c11 {111.9/AR}
.ends QPCORE
